                                "sense_id": "a013423d-ea45-3841-bbb4-ef8f180fb283",
                                "text": "I know, from picking up the post from the hall in the mornings, that Jaz has a mother in Northumbria who thinks her daughter's name is Janette. That jaunty z is but a wedge of lemon stuck into a bottle of beer."
